{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991280/extras/eacb3079214d59b7c3aecd0d06787b9b.avif?t=1731246711\" width=200 height=92 /></span><br><br><u>Note that this game is just an arcade game.</u><br><br>This is a 3D flight action arcade game.<br>This game was updated in February 2019 to version 2.00.<br>Various fighter planes, transport planes and drone planes will appear.<br>The player's aircraft has been changed to the XF-97 prototype.<br>6 levels have been added.<br>All the music in version 2 was composed by NS.<br><br>Level 1: Maxell The federal UAVs are violating our airspace. Board the XF-97 prototype and make a sortie.<br>Level 2: Enemy aircrafts are gathering at our border. You can cope with this problem.<br>Level 3: They are transporting supplies for war by AC-130. They will give up war if the supplies are gone.<br>Extra stage 1,2: The enemy's ace pilot does not seem to give up war yet. Shoot down them all.<br>STEAM leader board level: total score until the player is destroyed will be stored in the leader board of STEAM.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Appearing countries</h2>Willsword - Player's country<br><br>Maxell - Enemy country<br>Ulcafy - Allies of Willsword<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Advances in radar technology have made stealth fighter a normal fighter plane.<br><br>Willsword country developed the latest fighter XF-98.<br>It is a fighter with high attack power and phenomenal durability.<br>Due to the MD armor equipped with this fighter aircraft, radar performance has declined greatly.<br>MD armor is an armor that weakens enemy missiles by irradiating missiles with high power laser and EMP.<br>The Willsword country further evolved XF - 98 and completed &quot;XF-99 Artemis&quot;. <br>This aircraft became the ultimate invincible fighter.<br>And feared as &quot;Fortress in the air&quot; from pilots of the Maxell federation.<br><br>Changing the graphics quality on the startup screen may make the sensitivity of the mouse optimal.<br><br>Method of operation<br>C: Switch the camera. <br>Mouse: Raise, lower and turn your own machine.<br>W: Speed \u200b\u200bup.<br>S: Speed \u200b\u200bdown.<br>A: Shift your aircraft to the left. (Yaw)<br>D: Shift your aircraft to the right. (Yaw)<br>Right-click: Switch your weapons. Missiles and machine guns.<br>Left click: Firing weapons.<br>ESC: Pause screen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991280/extras/7aaaa65f87ab9c4ab1171cae205727c7.avif?t=1731246711\" width=500 height=300 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Air Combat Level 1 completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/991280/79a5fc84aba01ce10e23c963101a0876de55d9b3.jpg"},{"name":"Air Combat Level 2 completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/991280/18180612acb010fa09fcbd670bad522f6e615e3e.jpg"},{"name":"Air Combat Level 3 completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/991280/0ea824f16bdbc19e62d817099c86a67e7136dae9.jpg"},{"name":"Air Combat Extra Level 1 completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/991280/ac5a44c2be16c98755a9c6c61b0433e5df5022a6.jpg"},{"name":"Air Combat Extra Level 2 completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/991280/59fdfb5da2ead2863047bc7a60b6ea6aed20192e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/991280?t=1731246711","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/991280?t=1731246711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991280/b90455b88a8c124f652b50dd74448ffa44e8a2bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1731246711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991280/b90455b88a8c124f652b50dd74448ffa44e8a2bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1731246711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>About Version 1.00</h1><p>If you want to play a game before the big update.<br>Right-click the game name from the STEAM application.<br>Click Properties.<br>Click the Beta tab.<br>From the drop-down list, click &quot;PUBLIC-RELEASE-VER 1.0&quot;.<br>To undo, click &quot;None. Don't participate in any beta program&quot; from the drop-down list.</p><br><h1>Aircraft Operations</h1><p>Use the A and D keys on your keyboard as well as the mouse.<br>You can move the aircraft left and right.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991280/extras/eacb3079214d59b7c3aecd0d06787b9b.avif?t=1731246711\" width=200 height=92 /></span><br><br><u>Note that this game is just an arcade game.</u><br><br>This is a 3D flight action arcade game.<br>This game was updated in February 2019 to version 2.00.<br>Various fighter planes, transport planes and drone planes will appear.<br>The player's aircraft has been changed to the XF-97 prototype.<br>6 levels have been added.<br>All the music in version 2 was composed by NS.<br><br>Level 1: Maxell The federal UAVs are violating our airspace. Board the XF-97 prototype and make a sortie.<br>Level 2: Enemy aircrafts are gathering at our border. You can cope with this problem.<br>Level 3: They are transporting supplies for war by AC-130. They will give up war if the supplies are gone.<br>Extra stage 1,2: The enemy's ace pilot does not seem to give up war yet. Shoot down them all.<br>STEAM leader board level: total score until the player is destroyed will be stored in the leader board of STEAM.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Appearing countries</h2>Willsword - Player's country<br><br>Maxell - Enemy country<br>Ulcafy - Allies of Willsword<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Advances in radar technology have made stealth fighter a normal fighter plane.<br><br>Willsword country developed the latest fighter XF-98.<br>It is a fighter with high attack power and phenomenal durability.<br>Due to the MD armor equipped with this fighter aircraft, radar performance has declined greatly.<br>MD armor is an armor that weakens enemy missiles by irradiating missiles with high power laser and EMP.<br>The Willsword country further evolved XF - 98 and completed &quot;XF-99 Artemis&quot;. <br>This aircraft became the ultimate invincible fighter.<br>And feared as &quot;Fortress in the air&quot; from pilots of the Maxell federation.<br><br>Changing the graphics quality on the startup screen may make the sensitivity of the mouse optimal.<br><br>Method of operation<br>C: Switch the camera. <br>Mouse: Raise, lower and turn your own machine.<br>W: Speed \u200b\u200bup.<br>S: Speed \u200b\u200bdown.<br>A: Shift your aircraft to the left. (Yaw)<br>D: Shift your aircraft to the right. (Yaw)<br>Right-click: Switch your weapons. Missiles and machine guns.<br>Left click: Firing weapons.<br>ESC: Pause screen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991280/extras/7aaaa65f87ab9c4ab1171cae205727c7.avif?t=1731246711\" width=500 height=300 /></span>","developers":["Sonic-Alpha"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991280/header.jpg?t=1731246711","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Paid Licenses<br />\r\nUnity Technologies/Autodesk Inc.(3D model materials)/Adobe./MAGIX Software GmbH.(the commercial sound sources)/SOURCENEXT<br />\r\nUnity Asset Distributors<br />\r\nHARDWORKER STUDIO